<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Friday's spot rupee rates in the kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   41.20		 41.30</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	67.50		 67.60</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 24.50		 24.55</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.335		 0.337</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.02		 11.04</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.27		 11.29</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.10		  1.13</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 3.00 pct	    3.20 pct</p>
</text>
